# Single source of truth: `.claude/` + `AGENTS.md`

This repository is maintained for Claude Code. Cursor Agent must consume the same
files — never maintain a parallel copy of instructions, skills, or rules.

## Already native to Cursor

| Artifact | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `AGENTS.md` (root + nested) | Auto-loaded by Cursor |
| `CLAUDE.md` (points at `AGENTS.md` + Kiro workflow) | Treat as entrypoint / workflow overlay |
| `.claude/skills/**/SKILL.md` | Offered as Agent Skills — read and follow when relevant |
| `apps/app/.claude/skills/**/SKILL.md` | Same, when working under `apps/app/` |

## Bridged via `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`

Claude Code auto-injects `.claude/rules/`. Cursor does not. Thin bridge `.mdc` files
`@`-include those markdown files. **Edit only `.claude/rules/` (and package-scoped
equivalents); update bridge file lists when adding/removing a rule file.**

## When to load more

- Skills: if there is even a small chance a listed skill applies, read its `SKILL.md` first
- Package docs: `apps/*/CLAUDE.md` / `AGENTS.md` when touching that package
- Specs / steering: `.kiro/specs/`, `.kiro/steering/` per `CLAUDE.md`
- Slash-style workflows in `.claude/commands/` and kiro skills: follow the matching
  skill under `.claude/skills/` rather than inventing a Cursor-only procedure
